# Build context of orchestration/Dockerfile (the repository root): only what the
# image needs. This keeps API keys (.illustris_api_key.txt, .hf_*), .env files,
# data, outputs, virtual environments and .git out of the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!pipelines/
!orchestration/dags/
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
